  <!-- Direct Answer Executive Summary -->
  <div class="direct-answer">
    <p><strong>Executive Summary:</strong> Postie is an open-source client-side API testing tool on GitHub designed to replace bloated desktop applications with an instant, zero-install browser tab. Operating entirely on standard Web APIs (Fetch, Headers, LocalStorage), the Postie GitHub repository offers zero telemetry, zero cloud logins, and sub-10ms initial page load with zero external runtime dependencies.</p>
  </div>

