      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Why use Postie instead of desktop API clients like Postman?</h3>
        <p>Postie requires zero installation, creates zero cloud accounts, and transmits zero telemetry. It runs in seconds directly in the browser with 100% client-side privacy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Does Postie send request data or tokens to any server?</h3>
        <p>No. All HTTP requests execute directly from your browser via native Web Fetch API, and request collections persist locally in your browser LocalStorage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How does Postie handle CORS preflight errors?</h3>
        <p>Postie provides actionable diagnostics when browser CORS policies block cross-origin requests, guiding engineers on Access-Control-Allow-Origin headers and localhost configurations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
